# DrumMania 10th Mix: power-on after the install (start from drmn10m-install's NVRAM). NOTE 605
# (RTC-RAM cleared): Test goes on. The boot checks and data loading, then the multi-session unit
# answers on SIO1 (it boots from its own CD meanwhile) and the game goes on to the warning screen
# and attract. MAME's multi-session unit is an empty stub, so MAME stops at "Please call
# attendant". Main RAM is MAME's until the game first touches SIO1 (frame 1688, 28.2 s), where the
# unit's link starts. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames.
game drmn10m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 10800 quit
